WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Downloaded from CINEFREAK.NET

00:01:05.678 --> 00:01:07.084
[rain patters]

00:01:07.085 --> 00:01:08.484
[car speeds past]

00:01:08.485 --> 00:01:09.851
[car crashes loudly]

00:01:19.806 --> 00:01:21.689
[ominous music]

00:01:27.546 --> 00:01:28.851
[ambulance siren wails]

00:01:34.018 --> 00:01:35.275
[car window shatters]

00:01:39.180 --> 00:01:40.423
[music swells]

00:01:46.018 --> 00:01:48.376
A lot of people have gathered
at the hospital.

00:01:48.463 --> 00:01:50.568
We're waiting to know
about his condition.

00:01:50.744 --> 00:01:52.344
As per the latest update
from the hospital...

00:01:52.345 --> 00:01:54.722
According to the accounts from
the people at the spot...

00:01:54.924 --> 00:01:57.488
that there was only one person
inside the car

00:01:57.489 --> 00:01:59.335
at the time of the accident.

00:02:03.035 --> 00:02:05.338
[monitor beeps]

00:02:07.859 --> 00:02:09.070
[door opens]

00:02:10.898 --> 00:02:11.948
Doctor?

00:02:14.576 --> 00:02:15.930
- My son...
- Sorry.

00:02:17.315 --> 00:02:19.822
- We couldn't save him.
- What is it?

00:02:20.185 --> 00:02:21.526
[crying]
What did he say?

00:02:21.527 --> 00:02:22.665
What did he say?

00:02:23.340 --> 00:02:24.587
What did he say?

00:02:24.588 --> 00:02:26.271
My dear son...

00:02:27.037 --> 00:02:28.933
[wailing]

00:02:28.934 --> 00:02:30.992
Oh, my dear son...

00:02:33.584 --> 00:02:34.834
[melancholy music swells]

00:02:41.991 --> 00:02:43.155
[sobs]

00:02:45.859 --> 00:02:47.546
[Menacing music]

00:02:54.217 --> 00:02:55.725
[heart pounding]

00:03:01.967 --> 00:03:03.077
[music sting]

00:03:09.569 --> 00:03:10.748
[Tense music]

00:03:37.295 --> 00:03:38.803
[intro music]

00:03:57.702 --> 00:03:58.928
[upbeat music]

00:04:04.734 --> 00:04:06.297
I've heard someone say

00:04:06.704 --> 00:04:09.935
our life is a gamble played
between God and Satan.

00:04:10.374 --> 00:04:11.528
Be that as it may,

00:04:12.070 --> 00:04:15.202
the history of gambling
is as old as mankind itself.

00:04:15.507 --> 00:04:17.365
From the dusty streets of Rome

00:04:17.676 --> 00:04:21.061
to the bustling markets of
the Ming Dynasty in China…

00:04:23.509 --> 00:04:25.185
From village games of 'Pakida'

00:04:25.312 --> 00:04:27.146
to the high-stakes gambling
in royal palaces…

00:04:27.584 --> 00:04:30.757
To roulette tables glowing beneath
the neon lights of casinos...

00:04:30.846 --> 00:04:32.889
Everyone tastes
the thrill of a gamble.

00:04:33.478 --> 00:04:36.185
When some rise, some fall.

00:04:36.823 --> 00:04:38.833
From the pauper who lost his home

00:04:39.194 --> 00:04:41.622
to the king
who lost his kingdom and palace…

00:04:42.138 --> 00:04:44.729
There's one secret
that every loser fails to grasp.

00:04:45.135 --> 00:04:47.548
The greatest secret of gambling.

00:04:48.186 --> 00:04:50.330
They all believe in luck.

00:04:50.938 --> 00:04:52.343
But that's not it.

00:04:53.026 --> 00:04:54.721
This is pure algorithm.

00:04:55.676 --> 00:04:57.402
[Fast-paced music]

00:04:59.455 --> 00:05:01.132
- I learnt that secret
- Cheers!

00:05:01.133 --> 00:05:02.859
watching this
shrewd Chinese guy play.

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:03.891
Loser!

00:05:03.892 --> 00:05:05.735
Whether it's gambling or life,

00:05:05.946 --> 00:05:08.023
there's a principle
you must never forget.

00:05:08.467 --> 00:05:10.208
A principle I live by.

00:05:10.923 --> 00:05:12.382
Nothing is truly the end.

00:05:13.422 --> 00:05:14.658
Never give up!

00:05:14.919 --> 00:05:16.325
[upbeat music]

00:05:17.982 --> 00:05:19.063
Cheers!

00:05:34.527 --> 00:05:36.010
I'M GAME

